column2:
Regretting what lay beyond that strength,
@9f5ea7af76615785	suffering, crumbling, yet alone,
@954a5b4f2d25a4c2	that person will rise again...
@ced399bbbf9ad249	It's the Shield of Purity that will save him.
@55b9a990a88b381c	Just as he will save the Shield of Purity.
@966b2a3c605db4ce	So I must set out.
@6ad67dc63c2c30ba	To protect the beauty of that heart,
@d665251501864d3d	and that heart's lamp.
